==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|heart-burn}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|heart|burn|lang=en}}, translating Ancient Greek {{m|grc|καρδιαλγία}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A burning pain in the chest that is caused by stomach acid entering the [[gullet]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|acid reflux}}
* {{l|en|cardialgia}}
* {{l|en|gastroesophageal reflux}}
* {{l|en|pyrosis}}

